WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.594
You've said this word thousands of times.

2
00:00:03.844 --> 00:00:06.052
Do you know what it actually means?

3
00:00:06.392 --> 00:00:07.416
ٱلْحَمْدُ
al-ḥamdu — All praises and thanks

4
00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:11.464
Tap any word. Hear it. See what it means.

5
00:00:11.704 --> 00:00:12.984
لِلَّهِ
lillahi — (be) to Allah

6
00:00:13.774 --> 00:00:14.735
رَبِّ
rabbi — the Lord

7
00:00:15.085 --> 00:00:19.048
Keep the ones you want — and see how often they come back.

8
00:00:20.898 --> 00:00:26.489
[Quran recitation — Al-Fatihah 1:2]
ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ

9
00:00:26.939 --> 00:00:29.964
Iqra. Understand what you recite.
